      "scores": {
        "command-surface": "9/10 — the product literally IS an agent that runs in/around a CLI; 'every claim is a command whose result grows from the prompt' maps 1:1 onto storyboard.json being written command-by-command, and the caret→collapse→aperture grammar carries the whole arc.",
        "defrag": "7/10 — reads the pipeline as a booting system/HUD of gates locking onto data; strong for the 'deterministic checks audit every render' beat, but the FUI reticle look overweights the QA angle and underplays the creative/free thesis.",
        "ignition-monument": "6/10 — it is a launch film with a manifesto POV ('you never had to trade'), and the cool→hot persuasion ramp fits the payoff; but a monolith-type template is thin on the CLI/pipeline substance and would lean on words over the tool itself."
      }
    }
